## 5. 参数验证规范

### Query参数验证

```python
from typing import Annotated
from fastapi import Query

@router.get("/roadmaps")
async def list_roadmaps(
    # 分页参数
    page: Annotated[int, Query(ge=1, description="页码")] = 1,
    size: Annotated[int, Query(ge=1, le=100, description="每页数量")] = 20,
    
    # 过滤参数
    keyword: Annotated[
        str | None,
        Query(max_length=50, description="搜索关键词")
    ] = None,
    status: Annotated[
        str | None,
        Query(description="状态筛选: draft/published/archived")
    ] = None,
    
    # 排序参数
    sort_by: Annotated[
        str,
        Query(description="排序字段: created_at/updated_at")
    ] = "created_at",
    order: Annotated[
        str,
        Query(description="排序方向: asc/desc")
    ] = "desc",
):
    """路线图列表查询"""
    return await roadmap_service.get_list(
        page=page,
        size=size,
        keyword=keyword,
        status=status,
        sort_by=sort_by,
        order=order,
    )
```

